OL,4,CSpeed camera fault may have allowed    
OL,5,Cdrivers to escape fines                
OL,6,GFurther problems with the accuracy of  
OL,7,Gspeed cameras on English roads have    
OL,8,Gbeen uncovered which may have allowed  
OL,9,Gdrivers to slip through the cracks and 
OL,10,Gescape fines.                          
OL,12,FNational Highways discovered issues    
OL,13,Fwith speed cameras last year,          
OL,14,Faffecting 154 out of 400 cameras but,  
OL,15,Ffollowing an investigation, said it    
OL,16,Fhad found another fault on units       
OL,17,Fmonitoring roads including those       
OL,18,Frunning between Huntingdon and         
OL,19,FCambridge.                             
